<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Macau interim net down 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Macau interim net down 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   28.81	vs 43.03</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  50.36 gain vs 72.83 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    45.78	vs 69.75</p>
<p>    Turnover		     42.46	vs 107.12</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hongkong Macau International</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hongkong Macau is a property investment firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$4.49 million on disposal of interest in an associated company and HK$45.47 million on disposal of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
